an treat one group with  medication and  with the last group you can do  stretching and strength training  at the end of the therapy you could then  investigate the success  and calculate with the help of the anova  whether there is a significant  difference  between the three forms of therapy  and now an example for marketing as a  founder of data tab  i might be interested in whether there  is different in age  between people who are using data tab  spss  or r for this i take a random sample of  people who use  statistical software and ask them which  statistical software they are using and  how old they are  so i have the group of people who use  data tab as a statistical software  spss and r and i want to know  if there's a difference in age among  these groups  i have only taken three groups but of  course you could use also  more groups what exactly is a research  question and an anova  the question is is there a difference in  the population  between the different groups of the  independent variable  in relation to the dependent variable  don't worry  we will go through the sentence briefly  you are probably wondering  why population what is the independent  variable  and what is the dependent variable the  independent variable is a variable with  a different  categories so in our example it is the  therapy type  with a group which learns the right  behavior for a slipped disk  the therapy with medication and the  strength therapy  in the second example the independent  variable is a statistical software used  with the groups data tab spss and r  the dependent variable in our example  was the success  of the therapy and the age we would like  to know  whether the groups of the independent  variables have an  influence on the dependent variable  therefore for our two example  the questions would be is there a  difference between the different  types of therapies in terms of the  therapy success  or is there a difference between the  users of different  statistical software solutions in terms  of age  now the last point why population  actually we want to make a statement  about the whole population  unfortunately in most cases it is not  possible to survey the whole population  and we can only draw a random sample  the aim is to make a statement about the  population  based on the sample with the help of an  anova  of course we did not carry out the  experiment on therapy success  with all peoples who have a slipped disk  but only with a random sample but we  would like  to generalize the statement for the  population  therefore we use the anova and check  whether the result is significant  or not now we have understood this  we move to the hypotheses  before you calculate an anova of course  you have to make the hypothesis  in the case of the analysis of variance  the null hypothesis  is that there are no difference between  the means  of the individual groups we have our  groups  of which we can calculate the mean in  each case  and our null hypothesis is now that  there's no difference in the mean  in the population the alternative  hypothesis  is that there is a difference between  the group means  in other words there is a difference in  the mean between the groups  therefore our null hypothesis says that  there is no difference  and the alternative hypothesis says that  there is a difference  all well and good now we know what the  null hypothesis are  but what does it mean exactly  let's say we want to test whether  there's a difference in the salary  between  these three groups group 1  group 2 and group 3. now of course the  salary has some variance  some people earn 500 views a month  other earn 2 600 euros a month or  some people earn 6 000 euros a month so  both in the population  and in our sample there is a variance in  the salary  now the question is where does the  variance come from  and can we explain some of these  variations by the three groups  so how much of the variation in the  salary can we explain  by dividing the people into these three  groups  in the extreme case the results could be  that the salary in group  one is distributed like this  in the second group like this and in the  third group  like this in this case the division into  the groups  could explain a lot of variance in the  variable  salary we have only a small variation in  each group  the result would be different in this  case here we would again have the  variable salary  and would divide it among three groups  here however we could explain  almost no variance by forming the three  groups  within the groups the variance is almost  as the same  as in the whole sample so it does not  matter  whether we form the groups or not  therefore the three groups have no  influence  on the salary if we now look at the  variants  within the groups we can see that in  this case  there's a low variance within the groups  and  in this case there's a high or large  variance  within the groups if we look at the  variance between groups  we have a large variance between the  groups in this case  so the means of the groups are far away  and we have a small variance between the  groups  in this case here the means of the  groups are not far away  now of course you want to know how you  can calculate an analysis of variance  there are two possibilities for the  calculation either you can use  statistical software like data tab or  you calculate the analysis of variance  by hand  to be honest no one will calculate the  analysis of variance by hand  but the knowledge is very useful to  understand more precisely  how an analysis of variance works in  this video  i show you how you can easily calculate  an analysis of variants online with data  tab  to do this just open datatab.net and  click on the statistics calculator  if you want to use your own data you  simply need to clear the table  and put your data into this table i will  use the example data  because we want to calculate an anova we  simply click on  anova and now you need to select  which variable or which variables you  want  to analyze for the anova we need one  metric variable and one categorical  variable  with at least three components so let's  say  we click on salary and we use  the variable place the place has  three categories new york chicago and  washington  and now you can see here the result of  the anova  in this case probably the assumptions  for an anova are not fulfilled  so you can also calculate the  non-parametric test  instead of the anova  but let's stay with anova so here you  can see the results  and here you can read the p-value  if you like you can also simply click on  summary in words  and you will get the results in words a  one factor  analysis of variance has shown that  there is a significant  influence between the categorical  variable place  and the variable salary okay now we know  how to calculate an anova online with  data tab  i hope you like this video and see you  soon  bye  you
 

